---
const proof = [
  { value: '< 2 min', label: 'Reportes con IA en Luz.ia', slug: 'luzia-agentes-ia' },
  { value: '+65%', label: 'Rendimiento en logística', slug: 'inteligencia-logistica' },
  { value: '6', label: 'Ingenieros liderados', slug: 'monitoreo-white-label' },
];
---
<section id="yo" class="section-shell about-section">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="section-kicker">01 / Una forma de construir</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Ideas complejas.<br /><span class="quiet">Productos que<br />se sienten simples.</span></h2>
      <p class="about-description">Soy Mich. Uno diseño, ingeniería e IA para convertir un problema de negocio en algo que las personas puedan usar de verdad.</p>
      <p class="about-detail">Uso la IA para explorar, construir y automatizar. Mi trabajo es darle dirección: elegir qué resolver, cuidar la experiencia y llevarlo hasta la entrega.</p>
      <a href="#proyectos" class="text-link">Mira cómo se traduce en producto <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" /></svg></a>
    </div>
    <figure class="portrait-study">
      <div class="portrait-top"><span>Diseño + ingeniería + IA</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
      <div id="face-anchor">
        <img src="/media/portrait-fallback-720.webp" alt="Retrato de Mich Rodriguez" class="face-fallback" width="446" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="portrait-cross cross-one" aria-hidden="true">+</span><span class="portrait-cross cross-two" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption><span>Las piezas encuentran su lugar.</span><span class="portrait-note">Un retrato hecho de partículas</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="proof-strip">
    {proof.map(item => <a href={`/proyectos/${item.slug}`} class="proof-item"><strong>{item.value}</strong><span>{item.label}</span><span class="proof-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .about-section { padding-top: 96px; }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
  h2 { margin-top: 28px; }
  .about-description { margin-top: 28px; max-width: 470px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .about-detail { margin: 16px 0 20px; max-width: 455px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .portrait-study { position: relative; min-width: 0; }
  .portrait-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  #face-anchor { position: relative; width: min(100%, 330px); aspect-ratio: 3/4; margin: 20px auto; }
  .face-fallback { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #000 18%, #000 82%, transparent), linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, #000 12%, #000 75%, transparent); mask-composite: intersect; transition: opacity 600ms ease; }
  .portrait-cross { position: absolute; font-family: monospace; color: var(--muted); }
  .cross-one { left: 0; top: 20px; } .cross-two { right: 0; bottom: 20px; }
  figcaption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; }
  .portrait-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .proof-strip { margin-top: 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proof-item { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 28px 28px 28px 0; }
  .proof-item + .proof-item { padding-left: 28px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proof-item strong { font-family: ClashDisplay, sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .proof-item > span:not(.proof-arrow) { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .proof-arrow { position: absolute; top: 32px; right: 24px; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; } .portrait-study { max-width: 380px; width: 100%; margin: auto; } #face-anchor { width: 260px; } .proof-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 48px; } .proof-item + .proof-item { padding-left: 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } .proof-item { padding: 22px 0; } .proof-item strong { font-size: 36px; } }
</style>
<style is:global>
  html.particles-portrait .face-fallback { opacity: 0; }
  html.motion-paused .portrait-note::after { content: ' · en pausa'; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html.particles-portrait .face-fallback { opacity: 1; } }
</style>
